{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #22312d; border: 4px double #dfc481; box-sizing: border-box; color: #f0e7cb; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 14px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #f0e7cb; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #f0e7cb; display: block; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 24px 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e深祖母绿绒布般的底色衬出细雅香槟金边框，让暗调排版在纯黑之外多了一抹复古华贵。\u003c/p\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 34px auto 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 14px 0 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #dfc481; border-top: 3px double #dfc481; color: #dfc481; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 12px 0; text-align: center; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e深墨绿里的复古沙龙气韵\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #f0e7cb; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\"\u003e低饱和墨绿长时间阅读比纯黑更温润柔和，搭配哑光金章节标题与象牙白正文，格调十足。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background: transparent; border: 1px solid #dfc481; border-radius: 0 0 50px 50px; color: #f0e7cb; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0; padding: 24px 18px; text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e真正耐看的华丽，从不靠刺眼高饱和，而藏在墨绿与哑金的分寸里。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/vintage-vinyl.jpg\" alt=\"暗调复古黑胶唱机与黄铜台灯\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 34px auto 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 14px 0 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #dfc481; border-top: 3px double #dfc481; color: #dfc481; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 12px 0; text-align: center; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e沙龙特刊的适用方向\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e精品咖啡、威士忌、爵士乐与古典影评\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e高端品牌故事与线下雅集回顾\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e自带完整暗色保护，原色还原墨绿质感\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #c5bc9a; color: #f0e7cb; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e敬所有经得起时光沉淀的好品味。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
